### Nexivo API — open in VS Code with the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
### Run "Login as admin" first: the session cookie is reused by the requests below.
### For an automated run of all of these (plus negative tests): npm run test:api

@api = http://localhost:4000/api
@adminEmail = admin@nexivo.dev
@adminPassword = Admin@12345
@editorEmail = editor@nexivo.dev
@editorPassword = Editor@12345

