########## Forms ##########

POST {{api}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Priya Test", "email": "priya@example.com", "company": "Acme", "subject": "New app", "message": "We would like to build a customer portal next quarter." }

### Bad body -> 400 with field errors
POST {{api}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "email": "not-an-email", "subject": "", "message": "short" }

### Apply (multipart). Replace ./sample.pdf with a real PDF path.
POST {{api}}/jobs/1/apply
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----nexivo

------nexivo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

Rohan Test
------nexivo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"

rohan@example.com
------nexivo
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="resume"; filename="resume.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./sample.pdf
------nexivo--

########## Auth ##########

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}" }

###
GET {{api}}/auth/me

### Wrong password -> 401 "Invalid email or password"
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "nope" }

########## Admin (requires the login above) ##########

GET {{api}}/admin/dashboard/stats

###
GET {{api}}/admin/badges

###
GET {{api}}/admin/blogs?page=1&limit=20&sort=-updatedAt

###
